OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is mobile phone signal in
OL,4,ALondon getting worse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon's mobile phone connectivity
OL,7,F"continues to lag frustratingly behind
OL,8,Fother international hubs" Mobile UK,
OL,9,Fwhich represents several network
OL,10,Fproviders, has said.
OL,12,FIts comments come as the latest global
OL,13,Frankings for internet speeds showed
OL,14,FLondon had fallen to 91st place, five
OL,15,Fplaces lower than last month.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
