OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is mobile phone signal in
OL,4,ALondon getting worse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FData commissioned by the BBC England
OL,7,FData Unit found some of the worst areas
OL,8,Fwere Liverpool Street and Covent
OL,9,FGarden, where service proved to be
OL,10,Fextremely slow and unreliable during
OL,11,Fcommuter peak rush hours but worked
OL,12,Fnormally during quiet mornings.
OL,14,FSo what impact does this this lack of
OL,15,Fconnectivity have on Londoners and
OL,16,Ftheir ability to earn a living and what
OL,17,Fare the reasons behind it?
